BookSync: the BookOrbit server's HTTPS connections verify the server (CROSSINK_TAILNET_ORBIFY_SERVER_TLS,
docs/design/server-tls.md). Requests to the configured server set a CA list instead of setInsecure():
the Let's Encrypt roots plus the certificate the user trusted (src/orbify/ServerTrustNet.cpp). A
failed check ends the handshake before the request, so credentials never go over it. The BookOrbit
login screen offers an unknown or changed certificate for trust, with its SHA-256 fingerprint.
Other hosts keep their existing policy. Host test: xteink/test/server_trust_test.cpp.

